{"product_id":"ldk-2","title":"LDK 2","description":"\u003cp\u003eLOVE RIVALSAoi appears to finally be coming to terms with her feelings for Shusei. But before she can come to a conclusion, she witnesses a shocking scene between Shusei and a beautiful woman. However, it turns out that Shusei is not the only one who’s popular with the opposite sex, as a younger rival enters the fray and vies for Aoi’s attention. One boy is enough headache, but what will Aoi do with two gorgeous boys as love interests?\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 127 x 191\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Watanabe Ayu\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781632361233\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 176\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45413374754969,"sku":"Manga-A-39781632361233","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68302d00a0f0a-LDK-2-_1.jpg?v=1748277062","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/ldk-2","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}